# The sound page of the Preferences window: the four buttons (Main, Voice, SFX, Music: each turns over, and the Main one turns the
# others with it; one turned on while Main is off turns Main on) and the four sliders (a click on the track, on each arrow, the mouse
# wheel), each followed by a snap (the sound object, the preference words and the music object are in the state), then Cancel, and OK
# once with the sliders where they are, so that their places are saved and read back when the window is opened again.
